#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Participant tiles and the participant panel highlight the current speaker when browser audio levels are available. Quality badges summarize recent browser connection stats such as RTT, packet loss, bitrate, frame rate and freezes for each remote participant."
msgstr "有瀏覽器音訊音量資料時,參與者圖塊和參與者面板會醒目標示目前的發言者。品質標誌會彙總每位遠端參與者近期的瀏覽器連線統計,例如 RTT、封包遺失、位元率、影格率和畫面凍結。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Peer-to-peer video calls with rich 1:1 layouts, self-view control, screen sharing, PiP, reactions and live quality indicators."
msgstr "點對點視訊通話,具備豐富的 1:1 版面、自我檢視控制、螢幕分享、子母畫面、回應和即時品質指示器。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pre-join and Devices"
msgstr "加入前與裝置"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:49
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reaction buttons send short visual effects over the active P2P session. They appear on the call tiles and do not create private-message rows."
msgstr "回應按鈕會透過目前的 P2P 工作階段傳送簡短的視覺效果。它們會顯示在通話圖塊上,不會建立私人訊息列。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:56
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_video_call.html.heex:47
